  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "How to read it",
      "items": [
        "The model classes are SQLAlchemy tables; each extends the declarative Base",
        "reports.service and similarity.service are Python modules of functions, drawn as utility classes",
        "A slot owns its versions and comments; a version owns its attachments and reviews"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Rules the classes carry",
      "items": [
        "next_state only allows the transitions of design Table 5.3; anything else is 409 INVALID_TRANSITION",
        "One draft version per slot (partial unique index); a resubmission copies the last submitted version",
        "A similarity check is advisory: decide() records the supervisor's decision and changes nothing else"
      ]
    }
  ]
